<h2>7-Day Money-Back Guarantee</h2>
<p>We offer a 7-day money-back guarantee for new subscriptions on Web App Hosting, Bot Hosting, and Managed Database tiers if our infrastructure fails to meet our published technical specifications or SLA commitments.</p>
<h2>Cloud VPS Allocations</h2>
<p>Dedicated Cloud VPS allocations and custom IPv4 address transit reservations are non-refundable once root credentials have been delivered, unless an extended outage occurs that violates our 99.9% uptime SLA.</p>
<h2>How to Request SLA Credit</h2>
<p>To request an SLA credit or refund, submit a support ticket in your Client Dashboard or contact on-duty engineers via Discord within 7 days of the incident.</p>
